& [Purpose]
  + make the proven lexical-to-semantic gate useful as a bounded provider-free compact record projection
  + prove exact field correspondence with the existing deterministic direct query only for an explicitly constrained overlap fixture

& [Inputs]
  + admitted immutable SemanticFabric
  + whole-replayed Slice4B2C semantic gate request and result
  + explicit requested detail kinds and positive projection budget
  + optional existing CantorQueryRequest and CantorQueryResult for overlap proof

& [Projection]
  + retain only scanner candidates whose semantic eligibility is Eligible
  + exact-resolve every retained address to one admitted SemanticUnit and package owner
  + always retain unit id unit digest kind status and eligibility
  + Term requests retain expression and aliases
  + Definition or Description requests retain meaning
  + SourceSpan requests retain the exact address source anchors
  + unsupported requested detail kinds refuse rather than invent or silently omit meaning
  + emit an explicit detail account and omission for every requested field not returned

& [Equivalence]
  + canonical replay the supplied direct query result with existing execute_query before comparison
  + require direct term_set to equal the compact eligible unit identity set
  + require exact-only direct search with empty contextual relation and learned selectors
  + require request purpose caller scopes read-only authority requested details and finite budgets to be compatible
  + require direct resolved subjects and records to account every compact record and no exterior identity
  + compare every projected field byte-exactly with its direct SemanticUnit or verified quote anchor source
  + bind both result digests exact compared fields and equality decision into a proof digest
  + never claim global query-algorithm ranking contextual or fault equivalence

& [Bounds]
  + maximum records is positive and hard-capped at 4096
  + maximum serialized compact bytes is positive and hard-capped at 67108864
  + complete projection refuses before partial output when either budget is exceeded
  + output order is canonical scanner candidate order

& [Validation]
  + strict unknown-field-denying forms
  + structural proof recomputation and canonical whole replay
  + deterministic equal input bytes
  + mutations cover gate proof address unit record requested field budget direct request direct result and equivalence proof
  + debug optimized release scanner and direct-query regressions workspace warnings-denied Clippy format evidence attribution and publication gates

& [Boundaries]
  + do not modify semantic_anchor_scan.rs or query/engine.rs
  + do not add lexical rank to semantic disposition
  + do not add provider model attention effect persistence remote hidden-state FPGA or Minecraft behavior
  + preserve and exclude narrative/turns/1786911720465_minecraftgenie_scope_handoff_negotiation.sop

& [Rollback]
  + remove only Slice4C forms projection equivalence validators tests and governed closure artifacts
  + retain Slice4B1 Slice4B2A Slice4B2B Slice4B2C direct query exact scanner and public CLI unchanged
